It's a syntax to [define configuration ](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/goauthentik/authentik/latest/docs), this part is creating an user and the "headscale" group:

```hcl
data "authentik_group" "admins" {
  name = "authentik Admins"
}

resource "authentik_group" "headscale" {
  name = "headscale"
}

resource "authentik_user" "example" {
  username = "example"
  name     = "Example"
  groups = [
    data.authentik_group.admins.id,
    authentik_group.headscale.id,
  ]
}
```

You can see the full file in this https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/1114#issuecomment-1795922761.

